get.description:
Vendored AutoEq parametric-EQ library (built by scripts/build_autoeq_db.py, upstream MIT).

Pre-gzipped on disk and served with Content-Encoding so the browser's fetch decompresses transparently;
lazy-loaded on first picker open.

Return a static tail of the daemon's log file (System-tab live view).

Read-only, no daemon socket. A daemon that cannot be reached, or answers the read with an error, is refused;
one with no log to serve is refused under a code of its own.
